{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在教室，我们只是朋友。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后两人独处的时候就是恋人。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种来回切换关系的生活，我们也总算习惯了起来。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理，下节课要换教室吧？一起走吧」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4301", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。去教室前我能顺路去趟办公室吗？」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6589", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好哦。哎呀，马上就要寒假了啊……」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4302", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，在教室里忍耐之后，\\n等到我们两人终于独处的时候，忍耐的反作用力也很大。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "不过，在教室里忍耐之后，等到我们两人终于独处的时候，忍耐的反作用力也很大。", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和她本人说出来又会让她在意，\\n所以我就没和她提。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "和她本人说出来又会让她在意，所以我就没和她提。", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪其实很喜欢撒娇。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前叫我臭虫的那个女孩子，\\n现在天天撒着娇跟着我。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "以前叫我臭虫的那个女孩子，现在天天撒着娇跟着我。", "plain_idx": 250, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她能发出那样撒娇的声音，\\n除我以外没有其他人知道，\\n这也让我有了些优越感。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "她能发出那样撒娇的声音，除我以外没有其他人知道，这也让我有了些优越感。", "plain_idx": 252, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，我们差不多也该走了吧？」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1752", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，是啊」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和隼太走出教室，\\n看向走在前面的纱凪和濑名同学。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": "我和隼太走出教室，看向走在前面的纱凪和濑名同学。", "plain_idx": 257, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种刻意保持的距离感，让我心里痒痒的。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4303", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪短短地回头看了我一眼，\\n沉默着对我露出了微笑。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": "纱凪短短地回头看了我一眼，沉默着对我露出了微笑。", "plain_idx": 262, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想要朝她挥手，但还是努力忍住了。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样的日常每天都上演着。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～？」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0620", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵，坐着舒服吗？」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜～♪」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0621", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵难得坐在我头上，\\n发出了开心的叫声。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": "熊喵难得坐在我头上，发出了开心的叫声。", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4304", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而另一边，则是我不那么开心的女友。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪。怎么了？」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……从刚才开始，\\n　熊喵就一脸得意地看着我」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": "「……从刚才开始，　熊喵就一脸得意地看着我」", "plain_idx": 277, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4305", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵得意？」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜？」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0622", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾脑袋上就那么舒服吗？」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4306", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜～♪」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0623", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你看，它那绝对是在嘲讽我。\\n　熊喵你这恋男猫～」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "「你看，它那绝对是在嘲讽我。　熊喵你这恋男猫～」", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4307", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她这是吃醋了么。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过她吃醋的对象是熊喵，我也不清楚该作出什么反应。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你要是想坐，就坐我头上吧。\\n　新吾是我的，你不能骑」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "「你要是想坐，就坐我头上吧。　新吾是我的，你不能骑」", "plain_idx": 291, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4308", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜（扭脸）」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0624", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃呃呃，完全把我无视了～！」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4309", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好啦，赶紧给我下来。\\n　只有我能骑在新吾上面」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": "「好啦，赶紧给我下来。　只有我能骑在新吾上面」", "plain_idx": 298, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4310", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜♪」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0625", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，不许撒娇！」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4311", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一人一猫争夺着我脑袋上的位置。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "作为男生这也算是有福气吧？", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿咻，大家辛苦了」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3304", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「辛苦了，学姐」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜，溜♪」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0626", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐来到活动室后，\\n熊喵立刻就回到了它平时待的位置。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": "美羽学姐来到活动室后，熊喵立刻就回到了它平时待的位置。", "plain_idx": 313, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵今天坐到新吾头上了呢。\\n　要记得说谢谢哦～」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": "「小熊喵今天坐到新吾头上了呢。　要记得说谢谢哦～」", "plain_idx": 315, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3305", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜～♪」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0627", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱纱也辛苦了～」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3306", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，好、好的。学姐也辛苦了……」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4312", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪与我拉开了距离，冷淡地回复道。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，今天小爱她们休息……」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3307", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「室外的工作我来干吧」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不用。外面的活我来干就行」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3308", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我也来帮个忙」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我立刻大声接话道，吓了学姐一跳。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4313", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为人手不多，\\n我要是去给学姐帮忙，纱凪就要一个人工作了。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": "因为人手不多，我要是去给学姐帮忙，纱凪就要一个人工作了。", "plain_idx": 332, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，纱凪……」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那我就在室内工作了」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4314", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪转过身去，离我又远了一点。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种时候该怎么办呢，我有些懊恼。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为和纱凪在一起了，所以就要和她一起工作，\\n不能给美羽学姐帮忙。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": "因为和纱凪在一起了，所以就要和她一起工作，不能给美羽学姐帮忙。", "plain_idx": 339, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……感觉有些不对。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「外面的工作真的交给我一个人就行了，好吗？」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3309", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐说完后，带着熊喵离开了活动室。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和纱凪留在室内，两人沉默了一段时间。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐一个人干活应该会很辛苦，\\n　你能去帮帮她吗？」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": "「学姐一个人干活应该会很辛苦，　你能去帮帮她吗？」", "plain_idx": 346, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪去帮忙比我去要好，我是这么判断的。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我说完，纱凪回头看向我。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用在意，你直接去帮学姐就行」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4315", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有美羽学姐在，\\n我们就没法像之前在教室里那样迅速转换关系。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": "有美羽学姐在，我们就没法像之前在教室里那样迅速转换关系。", "plain_idx": 352, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎样都有些不太自然。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「行了行了，别发呆了赶紧去帮忙吧」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4316", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也要检查一下设备的库存……」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4317", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好的。干完活之后，要一起回去吗？」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。你也要好好加油哦」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4318", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪没有回头，继续工作着。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那天回家路上。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪不像往日那样精神。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使我俩手牵着手一起走着，她也常常落后一步。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是哪里不舒服吗？」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……没事」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4319", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "类似这样的问答不断重复着。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道原因是美羽学姐，\\n但纱凪看起来并不想聊这件事。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": "我知道原因是美羽学姐，但纱凪看起来并不想聊这件事。", "plain_idx": 370, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然啊」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4320", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，你很受女生欢迎啊。一直以来都是」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4321", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么突然说这个？」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天休息时间也是，\\n　有一个女生说想和你表白，\\n　和你一起过圣诞节」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": "「今天休息时间也是，　有一个女生说想和你表白，　和你一起过圣诞节」", "plain_idx": 378, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4322", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那是个很可爱的女孩」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4323", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那么可爱的女孩都喜欢上你了，\\n　我很惊讶」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": "「……那么可爱的女孩都喜欢上你了，　我很惊讶」", "plain_idx": 383, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4324", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「其他女生的事情无所谓啦」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么？\\n　你被别人说受女生欢迎，应该也会开心吧？」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": "「为什么？　你被别人说受女生欢迎，应该也会开心吧？」", "plain_idx": 387, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4325", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有个这么受欢迎的男朋友，我也挺得意的」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4326", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这并不是她的真心话。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我明白这一点，\\n所以我没有笑，只是盯着纱凪。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": "我明白这一点，所以我没有笑，只是盯着纱凪。", "plain_idx": 393, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「其实」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4327", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你就算出轨了我也不会生气的，\\n　别让我知道就行了」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": "「你就算出轨了我也不会生气的，　别让我知道就行了」", "plain_idx": 397, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4328", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我就这么没有信用吗？」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只、只是说如果啦」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4329", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我不会出轨的，\\n　而且如果真的出轨了，我觉得你可以尽情地生气」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": "「我不会出轨的，　而且如果真的出轨了，我觉得你可以尽情地生气」", "plain_idx": 403, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4330", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在她眼里是个会出轨的男人。", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这让我很伤心，同时也觉得自己很没出息。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我不会生气的」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4331", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪说着，靠在了我的胸前。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我不会生气的，因为我就是这么地喜欢你」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4332", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我这算不算那种听话的备胎女啊？」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4333", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我笑不出来，紧紧地抱住纱凪的身体。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她身子脱了力，柔软得让我惊讶。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "似乎真的随时会崩溃。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
